## Arhitectură Recomandată

Urmând exact pattern-ul Laravel existent:

```
pkg/parser/php/
  wordpress/
    analyzer.go          ← wrapper peste php.PackageInfo, coordonează sub-analyzeri
    hooks.go             ← add_action / add_filter / do_action / apply_filters
    post_types.go        ← register_post_type / register_taxonomy
    shortcodes.go        ← add_shortcode
    blocks.go            ← register_block_type / register_block_pattern (Gutenberg)
    widgets.go           ← WP_Widget detection
    admin.go             ← add_menu_page / register_setting
    plugin_header.go     ← Plugin Name / Theme metadata
    types.go             ← WPHook, PostType, Shortcode, Block, etc.
    oxygen/
      analyzer.go        ← OxyEl detection, ct_builder_json parsing
      types.go           ← OxygenElement, OxygenTemplate, CodeBlock
    woocommerce/
      analyzer.go        ← WC-specific hooks detection
      types.go           ← WC-specific types
```

### Detectare Automată WP vs Laravel
Poți detecta automat dacă proiectul este WordPress sau Laravel:

```go
// WordPress indicators
if fileExists("wp-config.php") || fileExists("wp-content/") || 
   headerContains("Plugin Name:") || headerContains("Theme Name:") {
    return "wordpress"
}

// Laravel indicators  
if fileExists("artisan") || fileExists("composer.json" /* cu "laravel/framework" */) {
    return "laravel"
}
```

